{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳將在12月3日出席美國參議院銀行委員會舉行的公開聽證會。根據該委員會官方網站公佈的通知，這場聽證會將圍繞美國出口管制政策及相關國家安全問題展開。值得注意的是，聽證會安排公佈之際，黃仁勳剛剛在英偉達董事會決定下重新出任公司行政總裁。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587712.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T18:39:12.055951+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T18:27:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:32:28.649663+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T18:32:28.649663+00:00","content_hash":"20f4aa43be0e3f916b7f8af0ca31cf75227b06363bb267d471795f45d025ca9e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}